lass=\"avatar-d lg\" style=\"background:#722ed1\">油</span><span class=\"avatar-d\" style=\"background:#722ed1\">油</span><span class=\"avatar-d sm\" style=\"background:#722ed1\">油</span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"avatar-d lg\" style=\"background:#722ed1\">M</span><span class=\"avatar-d\" style=\"background:#722ed1\">M</span><span class=\"avatar-d sm\" style=\"background:#722ed1\">M</span>","when":"按信息层级区分尺寸，例如个人中心使用较大头像，评论区使用较小头像","when_en":"Match the avatar size to its context—for example, use a larger avatar on a profile page and a smaller one beside a comment."},{"cn":"头像组","en":"Group","demo":"<span class=\"avatar-group-d\"><span class=\"avatar-d\" style=\"background:url('/assets/avatar-fox.png') center/cover\"></span><span class=\"avatar-d\" style=\"background:#165dff\">林</span><span class=\"avatar-d\" style=\"background:url('/assets/avatar-robot.png') center/cover\"></span><span class=\"avatar-d\" style=\"background:#626c7a\">+5</span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"avatar-group-d\"><span class=\"avatar-d\" style=\"background:url('/assets/avatar-fox.png') center/cover\"></span><span class=\"avatar-d\" style=\"background:#165dff\">A</span><span class=\"avatar-d\" style=\"background:url('/assets/avatar-robot.png') center/cover\"></span><span class=\"avatar-d\" style=\"background:#626c7a\">+5</span></span>","when":"展示参与者范围，并提供完整名单入口","when_en":"Show the range of participants and provide access to the complete list"}],"use":[{"t":"<b>评论区、动态</b>里标识这话是谁说的","m":"avatar-comment"},{"t":"<b>团队成员</b>列表、协作者头像组","m":"avatar-group"},{"t":"<b>个人中心</b>的大号头像","m":"avatar-profile"},{"t":"用户没传图时用<b>名字首字符</b>兜底","m":"avatar-initial"}],"dont":[{"t":"<b>只给头像不给名字</b>，相似头像难以对应到具体成员","m":"avatar-noname","bad":true},{"t":"圆形展示的风景图或插画仍属于 {c:image}，不应当作头像","m":"avatar-deco","bad":true},{"t":"<b>证件照</b>要完整信息，圆形裁切会裁掉关键部分","m":"avatar-crop","bad":true},{"t":"同一屏<b>反复出现同一个人</b>的大头像","m":"avatar-repeat","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"评论区里多人头像相似，还有用户没有上传照片。怎样让每条评论的作者仍然容易识别？","options":[{"id":"avatar-name-fallback","label":"头像旁持续显示姓名，缺少图片时用姓名首字作兜底","feedback":"头像帮助快速扫读，姓名负责明确身份，稳定的首字兜底还能覆盖图片缺失情况。","correct":true},{"id":"photo-only","label":"只显示圆形照片，把完整姓名放进鼠标悬停提示","feedback":"相似照片难以区分，触屏和键盘用户也不能稳定依赖悬停提示确认身份。","correct":false},{"id":"initials-only","label":"所有人统一显示姓名首字，评论区域不再重复显示姓名","feedback":"首字可能重复，只适合作为缺图兜底；没有姓名时仍无法确认具体作者。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"Several commenters have similar profile photos and some uploaded no photo. How can each author remain easy to identify?","options":[{"id":"avatar-name-fallback","label":"Keep the name beside the avatar and fall back to name initials when the image is missing","feedback":"The avatar speeds scanning, the name confirms identity, and a stable initials fallback covers missing images.","correct":true},{"id":"photo-only","label":"Show only circular photos and put the full name in a hover tooltip","feedback":"Similar photos are hard to distinguish, and touch or keyboard users cannot reliably depend on hover for identity.","correct":false},{"id":"initials-only","label":"Use initials for everyone and remove repeated names from the comment area","feedback":"Initials can collide and work only as an image fallback. Without names, the specific author remains unclear.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请让评论作者始终显示头像和姓名；没有图片或加载失败时，用姓名首字作为兜底，但不要隐藏姓名。用相同首字、相似头像和超长姓名分别验证身份仍可区分。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Always show each comment author's avatar and name. Fall back to name initials when the image is missing or fails, but never hide the name. Test duplicate initials, similar photos, and very long names for clear identification."}},"scenes":["评论区","团队成员列表","个人中心","协作者展示"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Identify a person in a conversation","m":"avatar-comment"},{"t":"Show a team or organization","m":"avatar-group"},{"t":"Display a compact account control","m":"avatar-profile"},{"t":"Group several collaborators","m":"avatar-initial"}],"dont":[{"t":"Use the 